Author:     Kyle Gruel <kylegruel@gmail.com>
AuthorDate: Thu Aug 13 21:16:33 2026 -0500
Commit:     Kyle Gruel <kylegruel@gmail.com>
CommitDate: Thu Aug 13 21:16:33 2026 -0500

    fix(engine): SOL-R3-02/04 follow-ups — absorb_edit trigger regression, stale receipt comments, recovery-residue ignores
    
    absorb_edit's committed-row refusal (UnsignableEdit on a trigger-nulled
    ceremony row) gains its own regression; vertex.py receipt comments updated
    to the read-back contract; .gitignore covers *.db.corrupt.* quarantines
    and *.db.recovery-lock.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C9MfGCNdAoSqKQ34mKevuF

